<h1>Cost Optimization on AWS</h1>
<p class="hero-sub">Strategies for managing and reducing AI/ML expenses while maintaining performance and reliability</p>
</section>

<div class="objectives"><h4>Learning Objectives</h4><ul>
<li>Understand the cost structure of AWS AI/ML services</li>
<li>Identify major cost drivers and optimization opportunities</li>
<li>Implement cost monitoring and anomaly detection</li>
<li>Master techniques for reducing compute, storage, and API costs</li>
<li>Design cost-efficient architectures from the ground up</li>
